    "description": "Step 2 of screen pinning: pin ToddlerLogic from the recent apps screen. ToddlerLogic is the brand: do not translate it."
  },
  "parentsZonePinStep3": "To unpin the app, swipe up and hold, or touch and hold Back and Overview at the same time.",
  "@parentsZonePinStep3": {
    "description": "Step 3 of screen pinning: how an adult unpins the app, with gesture or button navigation."
  },
  "parentsZonePinNote": "Names and steps may vary between phone brands.",
  "@parentsZonePinNote": {
    "description": "Small note under the screen pinning steps."
  },
